{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18103670","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18103670","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1810367001:1":{"text":"テペシュ。","source_cn":"苔佩希。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21ECC5424A0423A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1810367002:1":{"text":"あらまあ……<style=\"highlight\">トーラン陛下の最も忠実なる近衛隊長殿</style>じゃない。","source_cn":"哦……瞧瞧，是哪阵阴风把<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6BA9C9533B33AEA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810367003:1":{"text":"いつもまたがっている可愛い仔馬はどうしたの？劇場の床を踏み抜くといけないから、置いてきたのかしら？","source_cn":"你那匹走到哪都要骑着的可爱马驹呢？为何不带进来，是怕它...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x266DF251E5262B13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810367004:1":{"text":"相変わらずふざけた口ぶりだな、舞台で道化でも演じるつもりか？","source_cn":"如果你不准备到台上扮小丑，就别用那种口气和我说话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729C9F0A5816E5A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1810367005:0":{"text":"心配しないで、<style=\"highlight\">グリーズル</style>。たとえトーラン陛下に劇団をサーカス団に変えろと命じられても、お前の可愛い仔馬に玉乗りをさせたりはしないわ。","source_cn":"别担心，不苟言笑的<style=highlight>格...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x796B4D94EA383713","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810367006:1":{"text":"それで、妾に何の用かしら？","source_cn":"所以，拜见余是为了何事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE14977FD58E53C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810367007:1":{"text":"陛下は<style=\"highlight\">グレイヴシフター</style>をいつ起動できるのか知りたがっておられる。","source_cn":"陛下要知道<style=highlight>亡灵转化器...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF19BE2DD04270725","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810367008:1":{"text":"陛下が使者を遣わしてそうお尋ねになるのは、これで八十八回目よ……","source_cn":"陛下已经派人来问过八十七次了，还没问够吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3895CAF9B8120AAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810367009:1":{"text":"さっさと、答えろ。","source_cn":"回答。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F486829A8D8F753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810367010:1":{"text":"答えは同じよ。装置はもう完成しているけれど、起動には陛下にお伝えした「あるもの」が必要なの。","source_cn":"余的回答和之前相同：建造工作早已完成，但启动它需要余曾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66017ECEAB4C6E20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810367011:1":{"text":"それなら、陛下のご命令で用意してある。","source_cn":"陛下已经许诺，给你提供启动装置所需的东西。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DE0457A740CF309","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810367012:1":{"text":"あら？それはどこ？","source_cn":"是吗？在哪？余怎么没有看见？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5E9DCB2BFA35E18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1810367013:1":{"text":"貴様の目の前にいるだろう。","source_cn":"就在你面前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1271B70DB38E5153","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1810367014:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810367015:1":{"text":"お前が……陛下の寄越した<style=\"highlight\">「絶対に忠実な魂」</style>ですって？","source_cn":"托安陛下许诺的，<style=highlight>“绝...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38D5ADE12CE4EE10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810367016:1":{"text":"あはっ、あはははっ！魂を永遠に奪われると分かっていて、黙って受け入れたの？","source_cn":"哈哈哈，哈哈哈哈！他要永久征用你的灵魂，你就这么坦然接受了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE7A0C3E5CA01AA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810367017:1":{"text":"貴様のような腐った下等な魂を、陛下に使っていただくわけにはいかないからな。","source_cn":"堕怠低等的灵魂不配被陛下使用——比如你这蠢货。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1C3C48E271F87BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810367018:1":{"text":"言われたものは用意したんだ。さっさと装置を起動しろ。これ以上陛下を待たせるな。","source_cn":"你要的东西已经齐备，立刻启动亡灵转化器，陛下已经不想再等了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9832B59C27308AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810367019:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1810367020:1":{"text":"はぁ……面倒だけれど、妾もそろそろやる気を出さないといけないかしら。","source_cn":"好吧……看来余这懒惰之人，也不得不打起精神了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67C4245EDBBEB695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:神秘的亡灵":{"text":"謎のグレイヴボーン","source":"神秘的亡灵","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:苔佩希":{"text":"テペシュ","source":"苔佩希","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格瑞泽尔勒":{"text":"グリーズル","sourc